# SAM.gov Entity API v3

Required or the API returns empty `entityData`:

- `samRegistered=Yes`
- `page=0` (0-indexed pagination, not 1-indexed)

Do not pass comma-separated NAICS codes (returns 0 results). Make parallel requests per code, then merge and dedupe.

Canonical implementation: `src/lib/sam/entity-api.ts`. Longer notes: `tasks/lessons.md`.
